        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel 28° Tubular Latch for AHI SIG (Sigma) Series lever sets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis tubular latch is specifically for <a href=\"/collections/ahi-stainless-steel-levers\">AHI Stainless Steel Leversets</a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIt is available for 2 3/8\" or 2 3/4\" backsets. For both Passage and Privacy functions. It includes a standard \"D\" type strike plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>To determine Backset: Measure from the center of the backplate or bore hole, to the edge of the door. </i>\r\n</p>",
